    <main class="sitecontent">
      <div class="section">
        <div class="wrapper">
          <h2 class="visually-hidden">Introduction</h2>

          {% for item in characters %}
            <p>{{ item.name }}</p>
          {% endfor %}

          <div class="intro">
            <p>
              Through the evolution of Cassian Andor from petty thief to
              revolutionary leader, the series depicts the struggles, victories
              and defeats of a revolution against an authoritarian regime of
              random deportations, constant military presence and mass
              surveillance.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
