          <h2 class="title3">Watch trailer</h2>
          <figure class="trailer">
            <video
              class="fluidvideo"
              src="assets/videos/andor-trailer.mp4"
              poster="assets/img/poster-trailer.jpg"
              controls>
              <p><a href="">Download the video trailer (mp4)</a></p>
            </video>
            <figcaption class="trailer-caption">
              <p>
                Andor is a science fiction television series created by
                <strong>Tony Gilroy</strong> for Disney+ as a
                <strong>prequel to Rogue One</strong>, released in 2016.
              </p>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
